      "layout": [
        {
          "widget": {
            "name": "intro3",
            "multilineTextboxSpec": {
              "lines": [
                "## How the data gets here\n",
                "Yearly Portal BASE files land in a Unity Catalog volume. A Lakeflow pipeline ingests only new files with Auto Loader (bronze), then types, deduplicates and checks every row (silver): rows that break a rule go to a rejected table with the rule's name. dbt-databricks builds the gold star schema and runs its tests. One weekly job runs both; the whole project deploys with a Databricks Asset Bundle."
              ]
            }
          },
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 0,
            "width": 6,
            "height": 3
          }
        },
